~ A library module. Items prefixed with `>>` are exported; everything else is
~ private to the module. Imported elsewhere with `<< "mathlib.qn"`. Names resolve
~ top to bottom, so `helper` is defined before the exported function that calls it.

~ Not exported -> invisible to importers, though the exported `add` below calls it: an
~ exported function may call a private sibling (docs/modules/README.md#privacy).
helper = (a :: Num, b :: Num) -> Num => < a + b >

>> add = (a :: Num, b :: Num) -> Num => < helper(a, b) >
